      "text": "Pagbati sa mga kawani ng Quezon City Government na ginawaran ng QC Service Award at Career and Self-Development Award! ✨\n\nRecipient ng QC Service Award sina:\n\n- Rodrigo Banag ng Office of the City Assessor (43 years in service)\n- Arcelia Dacua ng Office of the City Assessor (33 years in service)\n- Aleth Dela Cruz ng Traffic and Transport Management Department (39 years in service)\n- Romeo Jao ng Traffic and Transport Management Department (32 years in service)\n- Ramon Bagtas ng Schools Division Office Quezon City (30 years in service)\n- Ma Cleofe Gorospe ng City Treasurer's Office (39 years in service)\n- Marcos Inguito ng Quezon City Citizen Services Department (28 years in service)\n- Jessie Taeza ng Parks Development and Administration Department (36 years in service)\n- Myrna Tato ng City Budget Department (43 years in service)",
